WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.450
<i>Takamagahara, a sacred place venerated</i>

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.070
<i>on the Star of the East as 
the locus of all ley lines,</i>

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.070
<i>is a bridge between the two stars.</i>

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:19.190
<i>The first War Armor from the Star 
of the West was delivered here.</i>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:24.640
We're sending new
 Giant War Armors to Caesar?

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:29.360
How can King Arthur tolerate a 
man who cannot produce results?

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.790
I would've already
 torn off his fingers for this.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.690
Caesar.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.930
If you disappoint us once more,

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.800
we will be forced to
 reconsider how we deal with you.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:44.890
Here.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.970
Thanks, monkey man!

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.050
Who's a monkey?!

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.150
Can I have one, too?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:51.810
Sure!

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.720
Hideyoshi!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.510
Everyone's looking for you.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.600
What's that?

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:00.650
Oops, I've been found.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.480
You stole that from the castle?

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.670
The war's made things chaotic enough already!

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:07.230
Don't get all uppity over supplies.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.030
Jeez...

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.340
Is something wrong?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.440
No, I was just remembering my little sister.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.570
Oh, you have a sister?

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.080
Is she on the wild side like you?

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.690
She died a long time ago.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.090
She was killed

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.330
by the Oda when we were still kids.

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.400
What?!

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:20.630
<i>United under Nobunaga,
 now the official clan lord,</i>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.110
<i>the Oda have decided to strengthen 
alliances with neighboring nations</i>

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:28.090
<i>in order to oppose the 
Caesar-Uesugi coalition.</i>

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:29.960
<i>The Oda are beginning to do just that.</i>

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.810
<i>With help from Himiko's Yamatai resources,</i>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.810
<i>the Oda steadily
 continued more powerful.</i>

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.020
Oda's forces

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.520
have reached a point where 
we can no longer ignore them.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.790
It seems so.

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:51.060
And do you still insist that
 you will not invade Oda with me?

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.280
I do.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.710
Well, now.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.180
Why did we even form an alliance?

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.510
I believe I have told you

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.770
that I agreed to ally myself with you

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:02.300
only for the sake of 
maintaining order during war.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.960
Impossible...

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.420
You foresaw that our

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.340
alliance would lead to the 
expansion of Oda's power?

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.290
It would have been simple to
 crush the Oda while they were lacking.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.470
But that would have been too crass, no?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.070
I fail to understand.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:23.000
It appears you do prefer the 
chaos of war to order after all.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.520
You are right.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.150
War is chaos.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.930
And chaos is only beautiful
 when it is consistently violent.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:36.570
Order in a time of war is chaos.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:43.150
And for chaos to be violent,
 large forces must be locked in conflict.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.510
Withered flowers are only beautiful

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.580
after they have bloomed in spectacular disarray.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.790
You're terrifying.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.920
I'm envious.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.900
In a way, a woman
 cannot truly come between men.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.600
Don't you agree, Ranmaru?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.670
Yes...

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:13.240
Er, well, I'm a man.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.140
What's wrong?

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.450
Is this the best you can do?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.460
Not yet!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.290
What?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:32.760
Got you!

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.600
She was killed by the Oda.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:39.970
No!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.310
Crap, I'm starving.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.760
Let me eat something, Nobu-sama.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.530
As a reward for scoring a point,

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:52.980
I'll give you one of my side dishes.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.170
Yeah!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.340
Nobu.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.050
What is it?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.260
Giant War Armors
 from the Star of the West?!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:08.760
Could it be a mistake?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.510
No!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.630
It's information I obtained, after all!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.670
The neutral zone, Takamagahara,

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:19.370
has always traded most with Yamatai!

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.900
You can count on us to
 get information from them.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.930
Caesar must have
 requested the Giant War Armors.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.160
He must intend to strengthen his forces.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.330
I see.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:34.520
He does not intend to stand
 idly by while we gather strength.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.750
So, how should we counter this, Mitsu?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:39.760
Leave it to me.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.410
Can we really use this?

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:45.910
In theory.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:50.050
I had shown Mitsuhide-dono 
its operation manual before,

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.810
but I didn't expect to use it so soon.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.180
You and Mitsu are both amazing.

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.950
If only I had a War Armor for myself...

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.820
Whoa! What?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:06.610
If you lack confidence,

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.900
it is not a bad idea to
 surrender to the quantum flow.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:15.310
Come to think of it, I was 
unable to draw a card before.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.940
Hey, it worked this time!

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.430
What is it?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:30.020
Temperance, also known as moderation, 
in the upright position.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.650
It signifies one's inner balance,

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.030
adequate control of the elements,

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:38.340
and harmony between the world and oneself.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.930
The world and myself?

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.270
I won't hesitate anymore.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.830
I'll do what I can.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.740
My betrothed,

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.600
I will be your strength.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.890
I will succeed without fail for Nobu.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:14.870
The time is now!

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:25.590
Caesar-sama!

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.020
Why the racket?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:27.840
What's going on?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.040
Oda Nobunaga and his
 men are advancing toward us

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:33.110
along with his Giant War Armor.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.250
Oh?

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:39.890
He's positioned his men
 in front of our vanguard?

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:42.070
He's as reckless as ever.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:43.350
We'll counter!

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.710
Men, to arms!

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:48.360
Did you hear?

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:52.220
Oda forces have shown up in 
front of our main encampment.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.060
A foolish move, given that 
Lord Caesar has obtained

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.670
a new Giant War Armor.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.530
They have acted in haste.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.170
Their security has become lax.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.610
As we intended,

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:09.380
they have focused most of their 
forces on the main encampment.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.190
I wouldn't have thought of 
using The Fool as a decoy.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.290
If we can't go to such lengths,

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.820
we won't be able to

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.840
steal a Giant War Armor.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.910
Takamagahara is 4,300 
meters above sea level.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:41.220
The control room and guard 
fortress are located alongside it.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.280
The transport ship from the 
West will arrive on Runway Two.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.710
Within the designated time,

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.720
that's where the ley line from
 here to the West is at its most stable.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:57.240
Security will be tightest on
 the east side of the control tower.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:01.360
But the greater problem 
will be the location's unique properties.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.530
Unique properties?

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:07.040
Takamagahara's geography 
exhibits quantum distortion,

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.370
with massive turbulence in its ley lines.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.030
In particular, operating War Armor

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:16.880
in the area reliably
 will be extremely difficult.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:21.090
The ley lines are so strong that 
War Armors will go out of control?

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.360
That's right.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.890
So here is a terminal
 we'll use to control the ley lines.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:34.230
This operation will be 
undertaken without War Armor.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:38.000
We should assume infiltration and
 espionage will be the most effective strategy.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.150
I have looked into when 
the guard shifts change.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:43.390
Well done.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:50.610
The rest is up to them.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:54.750
This apparently used to be 
an underground waterway.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.410
It's kind of creepy...

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.050
Want some?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.660
I'm surprised you can 
eat at a time like this.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.900
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.480
Nor can you live.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:40.010
If you don't have anything to eat,
 after a few days

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.660
you even can't even 
keep yourself from drooling.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.520
It's a sad way to die.

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:48.560
Are you talking about your sister?

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:53.180
We were farmers living on Oda lands.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:56.170
We lived hand-to-mouth,

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.650
but it wasn't such a bad life.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:04.430
But the famine changed everything.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.310
Because of some stupid war,

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.260
our meager harvest was 
taken away to pay our taxes,

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.120
and we had no choice but to starve.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.370
My sister, Asahi,
 was never that strong to begin with.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:26.210
She died without much of a struggle.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.000
I wish I could've at least fed 
her some rice before she died.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.350
Hideyoshi...

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.330
It's a common enough tale.

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.090
It's just how things are here.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.080
I don't hate the Oda clan for it.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.630
Nah, that's a lie.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.540
I did hate them.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:56.100
I thought about avenging my sister
 and the others who starved to death.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:13:00.400
I enlisted in the Oda
 army for that reason, actually.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.460
Oh! Don't get me wrong.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.680
I don't think that way at all now.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.640
Instead, I'm cheering Nobu-sama on as he

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.650
tries to seize heaven and earth.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.840
It's because Nobu-sama is strong.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.590
The strongest warlord should rule.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:17.690
It's only natural, right?

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.420
Because he's strong?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:22.700
Absolute dominion—that's a big deal.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.430
If he can do it,

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.670
no one else has to end up like Asahi.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:32.160
So I thought seeing this through 
would be a way to honor her memory.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.660
I see....

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:40.020
But if Nobu-sama shows 
weakness in front of me...

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:41.850
Watch out!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:48.170
If that happens, I will kill Nobu-sama

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:50.090
and rule heaven and earth myself!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.860
Oh, keep this a secret from Nobu-sama.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.580
Invaders!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.840
They went that way!

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.250
Don't let them escape!

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.480
Quite a delayed welcome.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.180
<i>Impossible! Oda Nobunaga's here?</i>

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:15.420
<i>Isn't he attacking Caesar-sama?</i>

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:19.000
<i>He's after the transport ship
 that's carrying the Giant War Armor!</i>

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:19.990
<i>Countermeasures!</i>

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.430
<i>Takamagahara is compromised!</i>

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.260
<i>Emergency ev—</i>

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:24.960
What's wrong?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.810
Respond!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:26.910
Respond!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:30.050
I see guide lights at Runway Thirteen.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:33.180
That runway's been abandoned for years!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.970
It must mean there's been an accident
 and the scheduled runway is unusable.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.460
Understood.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.860
Changing runway.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.020
What's going on?

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.650
We're being jammed!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.660
Call him back!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:49.470
Touchdown unit Uno to all Cinque units,

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.770
land on former Runway Six.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:52.650
Understood.

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:56.520
This is your end, Oda Nobunaga.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.520
You heard that, Mitsu?

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.160
Yeah.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.610
This is the end.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.670
Everything is in place.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.640
Here we go!

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:19.780
Wh-What's happening?!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.130
That boulder was in the way.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.300
What's going on?!

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.670
What is that?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.390
Such a large ship
 couldn't possibly be here...

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.670
How is it staying afloat?!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.330
Quantum condenser, huh?

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.760
What a nice thing you've made.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.180
This place is thick with ley lines.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.900
The device gathers their energy together

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:58.190
and rearranges them
 according to our own design.

00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:02.190
It is usable only because 
we are in Takamagahara.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:05.490
As long as the ley line 
turbulence can be calmed,

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.360
War Armors can be used.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.600
Sir Mitsuhide has won this round.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.370
I would not want him as my enemy.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.480
It's no use!

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.150
The incoming ship isn't responding.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.380
What are we going to tell Lord Caesar?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.740
Runway Thirteen?!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:23.870
Why there?

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.680
At any rate, get the comms back online!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.850
We just have to go get it now!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.490
Unfortunately for you...

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:43.400
My lord, Caesar, is always 
prepared for all eventualities!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.470
Maggots!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:52.950
What is going on?!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.250
Not under my watch!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:57.980
Hideyoshi!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.870
Move! Move!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:09.930
Please!

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:17.130
I won't let you bully the weak!

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:25.570
I'm your opponent.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.110
Is there an orchestrator 
inside that War Armor?

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.410
Nobu!

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.150
You are too weak.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.290
Are you a rank amateur?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.580
Damn it. Is this going to be a wash?

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.300
Nobu-sama!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.200
Could that be...

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.670
Don't be reckless, Nobu-sama!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.200
Stay back!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.470
I can't agree to that.

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:59.540
If I abandon my comrades,
 I can hardly manage ruling the world!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.940
Nobu-sama, you're so...

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.080
What?!

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:13.560
Did he just fire an arrow 
precisely between the

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.460
Giant War Armor's two armor plates?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.460
So this is the Oda Nobunaga 
I've heard so much about!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:21.060
You...!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.800
Nobunaga!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.840
Stop!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:42.050
Hideyoshi!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.050
That's right...

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.550
Monkey, out of the way!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.820
It's not because he's strong.

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.040
That's not it.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:55.390
In the end, I got taken in 
by Nobu-sama's integrity.

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.830
How big of a person he is.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.200
You little rat!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:00.840
I have...

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.140
no time for you!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.880
Not bad.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:09.390
If I can die for Nobu-sama, it's not bad...

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.180
Don't be an idiot, Monkey!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:16.120
You thought you could kill me 
with that level of resolve?!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.040
How did you know that?

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.450
Don't underestimate me, Monkey!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:23.930
You seek to take the life of a
 man who will unite heaven and earth!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.740
You knew?

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:27.900
You knew, yet you kept me beside you?!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.930
You're still in the middle 
of a fight, you bastards!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:38.640
You've got me beat.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.590
I can't.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:46.370
I still can't die!

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:47.750
I've made up my mind!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.990
I'm not just going to follow you, Nobu-sama.

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.470
I'm going to stand beside you...

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:55.030
and become a man who can 
shape this era together with you.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:59.490
In exchange, you'll have to prepare yourself!

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.400
If you ever show any sign of weakness,

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.400
I'll cut you down!

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.630
Die now!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.490
That's the spirit!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:13.310
If you want to kill me, you also need power!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:14.310
Nobu!

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.310
Nobunaga!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.580
Accept!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:26.660
This is...

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.980
Lord Shingen's Regalia of wind!

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.290
I entrust it to you!

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:35.140
Seek the power that will 
allow you to walk beside me!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:37.170
To kill me!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.340
Regalia!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.900
Give me strength!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.240
Wind, clouds, snow,

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:53.560
become as one through the Regalia!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.190
The power of balance and harmony...

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:13.080
Riding upon a cloud! It's like a legend!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:17.140
Indeed, the cloud, Kinto'un,
 that I've heard of in Eastern legend.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:22.290
It seems I have a new
 guest to invite to the banquet.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.440
Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.090
Goku...

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:31.940
is here!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.960
He activated the Regalia?!

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.310
He's one of the chosen?!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.190
You!

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.530
Bastard!

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:43.430
Be as fast as the wind!

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.310
I, defeated?

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:04.750
Don't regret giving me power, Nobu-sama!

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:09.930
Become man enough to
 make me regret it, Monkey!

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.350
It's over.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.600
The enemy is retreating!

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:22.920
The flames are preventing us from pursuit!

00:22:23.630 --> 00:22:25.790
One of the Giant War Armor units

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.990
sent to us has been taken by Oda Nobunaga!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:34.730
You fooled me, Nobunaga.

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:37.950
Just wait, Asahi!

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:39.730
Your bro's gonna do it!

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.420
<i>The dragons dance to the death,</i>

00:24:14.420 --> 00:24:16.650
<i>a dance I could not witness 
upon the Star of the West.</i>

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:19.250
<i>The long-awaited time has finally come.</i>

00:24:19.650 --> 00:24:21.590
<i>Next time: Death.</i>

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:25.330
<i>Are you the Grim Reaper? Or...</i>
